WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.165 --> 00:00:03.540
Isabella Fitzwilliam,
heiress of Blayne.

00:00:03.540 --> 00:00:05.305
The finest jewel of all.

00:00:05.305 --> 00:00:06.595
What do you want?

00:00:06.595 --> 00:00:08.672
You've done something
naughty haven't you?

00:00:08.672 --> 00:00:11.333
I am a clever beast, like you.

00:00:11.333 --> 00:00:13.640
Now give me what I want.

